{"id":415,"title":"常见有用数学公式","summary":"学习一些常见数学公式，使计算时间复杂度更容易！","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"3762cb06-cb19-49f6-bc91-6c58a073e70b","text":"## 公式\n\n下面的公式列表，在计算时间复杂度时可能会有帮助：\n\n$$$$\n| **求和公式**    | **等于** | \n| :-------------:|:-------------:|\n|$\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^n c \\right) = c + c+ c + \\cdots + c$|$cn$|\n| $\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^n i \\right) = 1+2+3+\\cdots+n$|$\\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$|\n|$\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^n i^2 \\right) = 1 + 4 + 9 + \\cdots + n^2$ |$\\frac{n(n+1)(2n+1)}{6}$|\n|$\\left(\\sum_{i=0}^n r^i\\right) = r^0 + r^1 + r^2 + \\cdots + r^n$|$\\frac{(r^{n+1}-1)}{r-1}$|\n\n\n一些处理对数的公式:\n\n| **对数公式**    | **等价公式** | \n| :-------------:|:-------------:|\n|$log \\;(a\\;*\\;b)$ | $log\\;(a) + log\\;(b)$|\n|$log \\;(a\\;/\\;b)$ | $log\\;(a) - log\\;(b)$|\n|$log\\;a^n$ | $n\\;log\\;a$|\n|$\\sum_{i=1}^n log\\;i = log\\;1 + log\\;2 + ... + log\\;n$ $= log (1.2...n)$ |$log\\;n!$|\n\n\n## 一般提示\n\n1. 循环迭代数组或列表 $c \\times length$ 次时，有可能在 $O(n)$ 时间内。\n2. 当问题的空间每次减半是，大概在 $O(log n)$ 时间内。\n3. 当有2个`for`循环嵌套时，一般是$O(n^2)$时间内。","text_html":"<h2>公式</h2>\n<p>下面的公式列表，在计算时间复杂度时可能会有帮助：</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\"></annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base displaystyle textstyle uncramped\"></span></span></span></span></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>求和公式</strong></th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>等于</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mi>c</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^n c \\right) = c + c+ c + \\cdots + c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1.0500099999999999em;vertical-align:-0.30001em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"minner textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"style-wrap reset-textstyle textstyle uncramped\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"op-symbol small-op mop\" style=\"top:-0.0000050000000000050004em;\">∑</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.30001em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.364em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathit\">c</span><span class=\"style-wrap reset-textstyle textstyle uncramped\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">c</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">c</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">c</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">c</span></span></span></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">cn</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.43056em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:0.43056em;vertical-align:0em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mi>i</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^n i \\right) = 1+2+3+\\cdots+n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1.0500099999999999em;vertical-align:-0.30001em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"minner textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"style-wrap reset-textstyle textstyle uncramped\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"op-symbol small-op mop\" style=\"top:-0.0000050000000000050004em;\">∑</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.30001em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span><